    "created_at": "2024-08-05T17:37:05Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-08-05T17:37:05Z",
    "body": "> It is unclear to me what specific spec changes need to be made on css-conditional-5 as a result of this resolution.\r\n\r\nI think the spec change needed there is to say that the [principle box](https://www.w3.org/TR/css-display-3/#principal-box)'s bounds are [unscaled](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-viewport/#unscaled).\r\n\r\nAlso: I added a [testcase](https://wpt.fyi/results/css-viewport/zoom/container-queries.html?label=experimental&label=master&aligned).",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
